        "paragraph_q6zmkk": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "name": "11/19 - 11/23 BFCM ",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p>Starting <b>11/19/26 through 11/30/26 at 11:59pm PT</b> or while supplies last, customers who <b>spend $125+ (USD)</b> or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive the <b>Dream Duo + Bonus Dream Lip Mask</b> which includes Dream Night Cream with Bio-Retinol (1.9 oz.), Dream Bio-Retinol Body Serum Travel Size (1 fl. oz.) &amp; Dream Lip Mask® with Bio-Retinol (0.6 oz.). <b>The Bonus Dream Lip Mask is only available through 11/23/26.</b></p>\n<br>\n<p>Customers who <b>spend $170+ (USD)</b> or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive the <b>Undaria Travel Duo</b> which includes Undaria Algae™ Body Butter Travel Size (1.7 oz.) &amp; Undaria Algae™ Body Oil Travel Size (1 fl. oz.).</p>\n<br>\n<p>Customers who <b>spend $225+ (USD) </b>or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive a <b>Hyaluronic Sea Serum (1 fl. oz.).</b></p>\n<br>\n<p>The applicable free gift will be automatically added at checkout. No code necessary. Offer cannot be combined and is not valid on previous purchases.</p>\n<br>\n<p><b>For subscription orders</b> to redeem, log in to your subscription account and add the gifts to your subscription order from the Sea Rewards subscription page by <b>11:59 PM PT on 11/30/26</b> and will ship with your scheduled order.</p>\n<br>\n<p>If an item goes out of stock during the promotion period, it cannot be purchased at the promotional price when it comes back in stock after the promotion period has ended.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Once an order is submitted, we are not able to make any adjustments or cancellations to the order. Exceptions will not be granted.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Offer is not transferable or redeemable for cash. We reserve the right to modify or replace any part of these Terms and Conditions and terminate this offer at any time without notice. Offer subject to change at OSEA Malibu’s sole discretion. Offer only available on www.oseamalibu.com.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "text-left text-sm leading-relaxed pb-6"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_aj9hCC": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "name": "11/24 - 11/30 BFCM ",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p>Starting <b>11/19/26 through 11/30/26 at 11:59pm PT</b> or while supplies last, customers who spend $125+ (USD) or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive the <b>Dream Duo</b> which includes Dream Night Cream with Bio-Retinol (1.9 oz.) &amp; Dream Bio-Retinol Body Serum Travel Size (1 fl. oz.).</p>\n<br>\n<p>Customers who spend $170+ (USD) or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive the <b>Undaria Travel Duo</b> which includes Undaria Algae™ Body Butter Travel Size (1.7 oz.) &amp; Undaria Algae™ Body Oil Travel Size (1 fl. oz.).</p>\n<br>\n<p>Customers who spend $225+ (USD) or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive a <b>Hyaluronic Sea Serum (1 fl. oz.).</b></p>\n<br>\n<p>The applicable <b>free gift</b> will be automatically added at checkout. No code necessary. Offer cannot be combined and is not valid on previous purchases.</p>\n<br>\n<p><b>For subscription orders</b> to redeem, log in to your subscription account and add the gifts to your subscription order from the Sea Rewards subscription page by <b>11:59 PM PT on 11/30/26</b> and will ship with your scheduled order.</p>\n<br>\n<p>If an item goes out of stock during the promotion period, it cannot be purchased at the promotional price when it comes back in stock after the promotion period has ended.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Once an order is submitted, we are not able to make any adjustments or cancellations to the order. Exceptions will not be granted.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Offer is not transferable or redeemable for cash. We reserve the right to modify or replace any part of these Terms and Conditions and terminate this offer at any time without notice. Offer subject to change at OSEA Malibu’s sole discretion. Offer only available on www.oseamalibu.com.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "text-left text-sm leading-relaxed pb-6"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_ahqpKC": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "name": "12/1 BFCM ",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p><b>Offer extended through 12/1 only</b></p>\n\n<p>Starting <b>11/19/26 through 12/01/26 at 11:59pm PT</b> or while supplies last, customers who spend $125+ (USD) or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive the <b>Dream Duo</b> which includes Dream Night Cream with Bio-Retinol (1.9 oz.) &amp; Dream Bio-Retinol Body Serum Travel Size (1 fl. oz.).</p>\n<br>\n<p>Customers who spend $170+ (USD) or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive the <b>Undaria Travel Duo</b> which includes Undaria Algae™ Body Butter Travel Size (1.7 oz.) &amp; Undaria Algae™ Body Oil Travel Size (1 fl. oz.).</p>\n<br>\n<p>Customers who spend $225+ (USD) or more (less applicable taxes, shipping and handling) will receive a <b>Hyaluronic Sea Serum (1 fl. oz.).</b></p>\n<br>\n<p>The applicable <b>free gift</b> will be automatically added at checkout. No code necessary. Offer cannot be combined and is not valid on previous purchases.</p>\n<br>\n<p><b>For subscription orders</b> to redeem, log in to your subscription account and add the gifts to your subscription order from the Sea Rewards subscription page by <b>11:59 PM PT on 12/01/26</b> and will ship with your scheduled order.</p>\n<br>\n<p>If an item goes out of stock during the promotion period, it cannot be purchased at the promotional price when it comes back in stock after the promotion period has ended.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Once an order is submitted, we are not able to make any adjustments or cancellations to the order. Exceptions will not be granted.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Offer is not transferable or redeemable for cash. We reserve the right to modify or replace any part of these Terms and Conditions and terminate this offer at any time without notice. Offer subject to change at OSEA Malibu’s sole discretion. Offer only available on www.oseamalibu.com.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "text-left text-sm leading-relaxed pb-6"
          }
        },
        "heading_cXDYFe": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<hr>\n<br>OSEA MALIBU\n<br>\nDECEMBER WRAPPED GIVEAWAY\n<br>\nOFFICIAL RULES",
            "heading_classes": "text-xl tracking-wide font-medium text-left",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        },
        "paragraph_xwJeQj": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<br>\n\nNO PURCHASE OR PAYMENT OF ANY KIND IS NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. A PURCHASE WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING. OPEN ONLY TO LEGAL RESIDENTS OF THE 50 UNITED STATES AND THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA WHO ARE 18 YEARS OF AGE OR OLDER AS OF THE DATE OF ENTRY. VOID WHERE PROHIBITED OR RESTRICTED BY LAW.<br><br>\n\n<b>1. PROMOTION DESCRIPTION</b><br><br>\n\nThese Official Rules govern the December Wrapped Giveaway (the “Promotion”), which is sponsored by OSEA International, LLC dba OSEA Malibu, 1795 Washington Way, Venice, CA 90291 (“Sponsor” or “OSEA”). The Promotion is one of a series of separate daily giveaways that OSEA is conducting from December 2 through December 8, 2026, as part of a campaign that OSEA announces on December 1, 2026 and may refer to collectively as “OSEA Wrapped.” Each daily giveaway is a separate promotion, and these Official Rules, as published for the applicable day, are the sole and governing rules for that giveaway. The December 1 announcement is promotional only and awards no prize. The prize for this Promotion is set forth in Section 5 and in the Schedule of Giveaways at Exhibit A.<br><br>\n\nEach Promotion begins at 12:01 a.m. Pacific Time (“PT”) on that day, and ends at 11:59 p.m. PT on the same day, as applicable (the “Promotion Period”). Sponsor’s computer is the official time-keeping device for the Promotion.<br><br>\n\nCertain Promotions include products, gift cards, or an experience provided by a third-party brand partner identified in Exhibit A (the “Partner”). The Partner participates solely as a prize provider, is a Released Party under Section 10, and is not a co-sponsor or administrator of the Promotion unless expressly designated as such in Exhibit A.<br><br>\n\n<b>2. ELIGIBILITY</b><br><br>\n\nThe Promotion is open only to natural persons who, at the time of entry, are legal residents of the fifty (50) United States or the District of Columbia and are at least eighteen (18) years of age (or the age of majority in their state of residence, whichever is greater). Employees, officers, directors, members, and agents of Sponsor and the Partner (if any), and of their respective parents, affiliates, subsidiaries, and advertising and promotional agencies (collectively, the “Promotion Entities”), and the immediate family members (spouse, parent, sibling, child, and their spouses) and household members of each, are not eligible.<br><br>\n\nThe Promotion is subject to all applicable federal, state, and local laws and regulations and is void outside the 50 U.S. states and D.C., and wherever otherwise prohibited or restricted by law.<br><br>\n\n<b>3. HOW TO ENTER</b><br><br>\n\nNo purchase or payment is necessary to enter or win. To receive one (1) entry, a person must, during the Promotion Period, complete all of the following on Instagram: (i) follow @oseamalibu and, for any Promotion that features a Partner, also follow that Promotion’s applicable Partner on Instagram, as identified in Exhibit A and in the applicable giveaway post (e.g., @sunlifeorganics); (ii) tag at least one (1) friend in a comment on the applicable giveaway post; and (iii) post a comment on that giveaway post responding to the prompt stated in the post (collectively, the “Entry Actions”). Entries that do not complete all required Entry Actions, or that are submitted outside the Promotion Period, are void. For clarity, because each day is a separate Promotion, following @oseamalibu or any Partner in connection with one Promotion does not carry over to any other Promotion, and entry into each Promotion that features a Partner requires separately following that Promotion’s applicable Partner, and responding to the Entry Action.<br><br>\n\nLimit one (1) entry per person per day for each Promotion. Use of any automated, robotic, scripted, or bulk means, or entry via multiple accounts or identities, voids all affected entries. Entrants must have a valid public Instagram account and comply with Instagram’s terms of use. Sponsor is not responsible for entries that are lost, late, misdirected, incomplete, or not received for any reason.<br><br>\n\nBy entering, each entrant grants Sponsor and the applicable Partner a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide license to re-post, display, and reference the entrant’s entry comment (including the prompt response) and handle in connection with the Promotion, to the extent permitted by the applicable platform’s terms.<br><br>\n\n<b>4. WINNER SELECTION AND NOTIFICATION</b><br><br>\n\nSponsor will select the number of potential winner(s) specified for this Promotion in Exhibit A in a random drawing from among all eligible entries received during the Promotion Period. The drawing will be conducted by Sponsor or its designated representative within approximately three (3) business days after the close of the Promotion Period. The odds of winning depend on the number of eligible entries received.<br><br>\n\nPotential winners will be notified through a direct message from Sponsor’s official account used for the Promotion and/or by email, and must respond and provide the information reasonably requested by Sponsor (including full legal name, email address, and a valid U.S. shipping address, and, where applicable under Section 6, a completed IRS Form W-9) within five (5) days of the date notice is sent. Failure to respond within that period, return of a notification as undeliverable, or a potential winner’s ineligibility or non-compliance, may result in disqualification and forfeiture, in which case Sponsor may, in its sole discretion, select an alternate winner from the remaining eligible entries or elect not to award the Prize.<br><br>\n\nSponsor will contact winners only from its official account(s) identified in the giveaway post. Sponsor will never ask a winner to pay a fee, provide a credit- or debit-card number, or send money to claim a Prize. Any message requesting payment or payment-card information is fraudulent and should be disregarded.<br><br>\n\n<b>5. PRIZE</b><br><br>\n\nThe prize for this Promotion (the “Prize”), the number of winners, the Partner (if any), and the Approximate Retail Value (“ARV”) are as set forth in Exhibit A. Any gift card, voucher, or experience included in a Prize is subject to the issuing party’s terms, conditions, and expiration/blackout rules, and its stated value is included in the ARV. The difference, if any, between the stated ARV and the actual value of the Prize at the time of award will not be awarded.<br><br>\n\nThe Prize is awarded “as is,” without warranty of any kind, express or implied, except for any manufacturer’s standard warranty accompanying a product Prize. The Prize is non-assignable and non-transferable, and no cash alternative or substitution is permitted, except that Sponsor reserves the right, in its sole discretion, to substitute a prize (or component) of equal or greater value if an advertised Prize (or component) becomes unavailable or is discontinued. The Prize will be shipped only to a valid street address in the 50 U.S. states or D.C. All costs and expenses not expressly included in the Prize are the sole responsibility of the winner.<br><br>\n\n<b>6. TAXES</b><br><br>\n\nAll federal, state, and local taxes on the Prize are the sole responsibility of the winner. When applicable under law, Sponsor will require the winner to furnish a completed IRS Form W-9 (including a Social Security or other taxpayer identification number) as a condition of receiving the Prize, and will issue an IRS Form 1099-MISC reflecting the ARV.<br><br>\n\n<b>7. GENERAL CONDITIONS</b><br><br>\n\nA Prize will be awarded only if the potential winner fully complies with these Official Rules. Sponsor reserves the right, in its sole discretion, to disqualify any individual it finds to be tampering with the entry process or the operation of the Promotion, acting in violation of these Official Rules, or acting in a disruptive manner. Sponsor reserves the right, in its sole discretion, to cancel, terminate, suspend, or modify the Promotion, in whole or in part, if fraud, tampering, technical failure, or any other cause beyond Sponsor’s reasonable control corrupts or impairs its integrity, security, administration, or proper functioning; in such event Sponsor may award the Prize from among the eligible, non-suspect entries received before the impairment, or elect not to award it. All decisions of Sponsor regarding the Promotion are final and binding.<br><br>\n\n<b>8. PUBLICITY AND PRIVACY</b><br><br>\n\nExcept where prohibited by law, acceptance of the Prize constitutes consent to Sponsor’s and the applicable Partner’s use of the winner’s name, social media handle, and city and state, and, where separately authorized, likeness, for advertising, promotion, and publicity (including online posting) in any media, worldwide, without additional compensation, notification, or permission. Where such consent may not lawfully be conditioned on acceptance of the Prize, Sponsor will instead request a separate written publicity release, and refusal will not result in forfeiture.<br><br>\n\nPersonal information collected in connection with the Promotion will be used for Promotion administration, winner verification, Prize fulfillment, and tax and legal compliance, and is otherwise subject to Sponsor’s Privacy Policy at <u><a href=\"https://oseamalibu.com/pages/privacy-policy\">https://oseamalibu.com/pages/privacy-policy</a></u>. Participation does not enroll an entrant in Sponsor’s marketing communications. Sponsor does not sell, or share for cross-context behavioral advertising, the personal information collected for this Promotion. California residents may exercise the rights described in the Privacy Policy.<br><br>\n\n<b>9. ODDS</b><br><br>\n\nThe odds of winning depend on the number of eligible entries received for this Promotion. The number of winners available is set forth in Exhibit A.<br><br>\n\n<b>10. RELEASE AND LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</b><br><br>\n\nTo the fullest extent permitted by law, by participating, each entrant and winner agrees to release and hold harmless Sponsor, the Partner, and each of their respective parents, affiliates, subsidiaries, advertising and promotional agencies, and their respective officers, directors, members, employees, and agents (collectively, “Released Parties”) from any liability, injury, death, loss, or damage of any kind arising out of or in connection with the Promotion or the Prize, including participation, acceptance, possession, use, or misuse of the Prize (including any travel or experiential Prize), technical failures, and errors in administration. Released Parties are not responsible for entries or notifications that are lost, late, misdirected, or undeliverable. Nothing in these Official Rules limits any liability that cannot lawfully be limited, including for gross negligence, fraud, or willful misconduct.<br><br>\n\nEach entrant and winner waives California Civil Code § 1542, which provides: “A general release does not extend to claims that the creditor or releasing party does not know or suspect to exist in his or her favor at the time of executing the release and that, if known by him or her, would have materially affected his or her settlement with the debtor or released party.”<br><br>\n\n<b>11. DISPUTES</b><br><br>\n\nThis Promotion is governed by the laws of the State of California without regard to conflict-of-law principles. As a condition of participating, each entrant and winner agrees that any dispute arising out of or relating to the Promotion will be resolved individually, without resort to any form of class action, and exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Los Angeles County, California, and consents to the jurisdiction of such courts. To the fullest extent permitted by law, no entrant or winner may obtain, and each waives, any punitive, incidental, indirect, or consequential damages, or any damages other than actual out-of-pocket expenses, and waives any right to have damages multiplied or increased. Except where prohibited, each party bears its own attorneys’ fees and costs.<br><br>\n\n<b>12. PLATFORM RELEASE</b><br><br>\n\nThe Promotion is in no way sponsored, endorsed, administered by, or associated with Meta Platforms, Inc. (Instagram), TikTok, or any other social media platform on which it is referenced, and each entrant releases each such platform from any liability arising out of or relating to the Promotion. Entrants provide their information to Sponsor, not to any platform.<br><br>\n\n<b>13. SPONSOR; WINNERS LIST</b><br><br>\n\nSponsor: OSEA International, LLC dba OSEA Malibu, 1795 Washington Way, Venice, CA 90291. For these Official Rules or the name of the winner(s) of this Promotion (available after December 31, 2026), send a self-addressed, stamped envelope identifying the applicable day to OSEA Malibu – December Wrapped Giveaway, Attn: Winners List, at the address above, to be received no later than January 31, 2027.<br><br>\n\n<b>14. MISCELLANEOUS</b><br><br>\n\nThese Official Rules are the complete and exclusive statement of the terms of this Promotion and supersede all prior or contemporaneous statements and advertising regarding it. In the event of any conflict between these Official Rules and any promotional or in-post materials, these Official Rules control. If any provision is held invalid or unenforceable, it will be enforced to the maximum extent permitted and the remaining provisions will remain in effect. Sponsor’s failure to enforce any provision is not a waiver. Section headings are for convenience only.<br><br>\n\n<b>EXHIBIT A</b><br><br>\n\n<b>SCHEDULE OF GIVEAWAYS</b><br>\n(each day is a separate Promotion)\n<br>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-bottom:20px;\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Date</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Prize</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Partner</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Partner IG Handle</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Winners</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">ARV / Winner</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Total ARV</th>\n      <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px; text-align:left;\">Special Terms</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 2</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">OSEA Dream Collection (Dream Night Cream, Bio-Retinol Body Serum, Dream Night Serum, Dream Lip Mask) + Full Orion Sleep System</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Orion</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">@orion</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">1</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$3,236</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$3,236</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 3</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">One (1) year supply of OSEA’s Marine Screen SPF 50 (12 bottles)</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">None</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">-</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">1</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$504</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$504</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 4</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Vagus Nerve Collection + Vagus Nerve Bath Oil + $100 Pause gift card</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Pause</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">@_pause.studio_</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">1</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$238</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$238</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 5</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">OSEA gift box + The NOW gift box + The NOW 50-min. massage gift card</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">The NOW</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">@thenowmassage</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">1</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$535</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$535</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 6</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$250 SunLife gift card + SunLife supplement line + OSEA hydration favorites</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">SunLife</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">@sunlifeorganics</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">1</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$828</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$828</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 7</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">OSEA Icons Set (\"30 for 30\")</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">None</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">—</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">30</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$165</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$4,950 Total / $165 per person</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Dec. 8</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Calamigos one-night stay voucher (winner + one guest) + guest room stocked with OSEA</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">Calamigos</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">@calamigosranch</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">1</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$1,031</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">$1,031</td>\n      <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;\">The Calamigos voucher is issued by and redeemable solely with Calamigos, subject to its terms, availability, blackout dates and expiration. All reservations, scheduling, and questions regarding the stay must be directed to Calamigos. Travel to and from the property and all incidental costs are not included. Sponsor has no further obligation once the voucher is delivered.</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br><br>\n\nValues are Approximate Retail Values (ARV) as provided by Sponsor/Partners. For the avoidance of doubt, where OSEA is working with a Partner, OSEA’s sole obligation is to deliver the Prize (or the applicable gift card or voucher) to the Winner. Upon delivery, OSEA has no further obligation. Any product, gift card, voucher, service or experience provided by a Partner is the sole responsibility of that Partner, and all questions regarding redemption, scheduling, quality or warranty must be directed to the issuing Partner. Lost, stolen, or expired gift cards and vouchers will not be replaced.<br><br>",
