e random selection process\nmanaged by OSEA (collectively, the “Selection Period”). OSEA thereafter will direct message each\nrespective Winner, dependent on what information OSEA has available, informing the Entrant that\nhe/she/they has won the Prize and instructing the potential winner to follow instructions on how to\nclaim the prize, as applicable. Time is of the essence in awarding a Prize. If, despite reasonable efforts, a\npotential winner does not respond within twenty-four (24) hours of the first notification attempt, or if\nthe notification is returned as unclaimed or undeliverable to such potential winner, such potential winner\nmay forfeit his or her prize and an alternate Winner may be selected.  If any potential winner is found to\nbe ineligible, or if he or she has not complied with these Official Rules or declines a prize for any reason\nprior to award, such potential winner will be disqualified and an alternate Winner may be selected.\n\n<br><br><b>5. PRIZES:</b> The Winner will each receive the following: 3 $125 Gift Cards (collectively, an MSRP of\nUSD $375).\n\n<br><br><b>6. GENERAL PRIZE CONDITIONS:</b> The Prizes will be awarded only if the potential prize winner(s) fully complies with these Official Rules. All portions of the prize(s) are non-assignable and non-transferable. All details and other restrictions of the prize(s) not specified in these Official Rules will be determined by OSEA in its sole discretion. No cash alternative or substitution of the Prize will be allowed. The Winners shall be responsible for all federal, state, local and income taxes (if any) associated with winning prizes. The Winners may be required to furnish his/her/their social security number for the sole purpose of preparation of any tax forms as required by law. Except where prohibited by law, entry and acceptance of prize constitute permission to use the winner's name and hometown, for purposes of advertising, promotion and publicity (including online posting) in any and all media now or hereafter known throughout the world in perpetuity, without additional compensation, notification or permission by OSEA. The Prizes set forth herein are awarded “as is” with no warranty or guarantee, either express or implied by OSEA. Winners acknowledges that OSEA does not make, nor are in any manner responsible for any warranty, representations, expressed or implied, in fact or in law, relative to the quality, conditions, fitness or merchantability of any aspect of the prizes being offered, except that each merchandise prize shall be subject to each respective parties typical standard warranty (if any).\n\n<br><br><b>7. ODDS:</b> The odds of winning depend on the number of eligible entries received.\n\n<br><br><b>8. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY:</b> By entering, Entrant agrees to release and hold harmless OSEA, and each of their respective subsidiaries, affiliates, advertising and promotion agencies, partners, representatives, agents, successors, assigns, employees, officers, and directors from any liability, illness, injury, death, loss, litigation, claim, or damage that may occur, directly or indirectly, whether caused by negligence or not, from: (i) such entrant’s participation in the Promotion and/or his/her acceptance, possession, use, or misuse of any prize or any portion thereof; (ii) technical failures of any kind, including but not limited to the malfunction of any computer, cable, network, hardware, or software, or other mechanical equipment; (iii) the unavailability or inaccessibility of any transmissions, telephone, or Internet service; (iv) unauthorized human intervention in any part of the entry process or the Promotion; (v) electronic or human error in the administration of the Promotion or the processing of entries.\n\n<br><br><b>9. DISPUTES:</b> THIS PROMOTION IS GOVERNED BY THE LAWS OF THE US AND THE STATE OF CALIFORNIA WITHOUT RESPECT TO CONFLICT OF LAW DOCTRINES. As a condition of participating in this Promotion, Entrant agrees that any and all disputes that cannot be resolved between the parties, and causes of action arising out of or connected with this Promotion, shall be resolved individually, without resort to any form of class action, exclusively before a court located in Los Angeles, California, having jurisdiction. Further, in any such dispute, under no circumstances shall participant be permitted to obtain awards for, and hereby waives all rights to, punitive, incidental, or consequential damages, including reasonable attorney’s fees, other than participant’s actual out-of-pocket expenses (i.e. costs associated with entering this Promotion). Entrant further waives all rights to have damages multiplied or increased.\n\n<br><br><b>10. PRIVACY POLICY:</b> Any personal information submitted with an entry is subject to the Privacy Policy stated on the OSEA website. To read the OSEA Privacy Policy, click <a href=\"https://oseamalibu.com/pages/privacy-policy\" class=\"link\">here</a>.\n\n<br><br><b>11. NO RELATIONSHIP:</b> The Promotion is hosted and managed by OSEA and is in no way sponsored, endorsed, administered by, or associated with ByteDance and/or TikTok, Meta and/or Instagram.",
